<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Sprout 2.0 (Part 3) – the community AI that starts empty</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 36 36'%3E%3Ctext y='30' font-size='30'%3E🌱%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
:root{--lift:56px;color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#eef3f0;--panel:#fff;--soft:#e0eae4;--ink:#14211b;--mut:#5a6b61;--leaf:#1f8a55;--soil:#8a6a50;--line:#d3ddd7;--on:#fff}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#0e1612;--panel:#16211b;--soft:#1c2b23;--ink:#e3efe8;--mut:#8ea397;--leaf:#4cc084;--soil:#a98a6e;--line:#27382e;--on:#04120a}}
@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){:root{--lift:28px}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
html{height:100%}
body{margin:0 auto;height:100%;height:100dvh;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:720px}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-top)) 16px 12px}
#plant{width:36px;height:44px;padding:8px;box-sizing:content-box;background:var(--soft);border-radius:16px;flex:none}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Avenir Next","Trebuchet MS",system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.015em}
h1{margin:0;font-size:27px;line-height:1}
h1 small{display:block;font:400 12.5px/1.3 system-ui;color:var(--mut);letter-spacing:0;margin-top:5px}
h2{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:20px}
h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:17px}
.sp{flex:1}
button,.btn{font:600 14px system-ui;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s}
button:hover,.btn:hover{filter:brightness(.96)}
button.pri{background:var(--leaf);border-color:var(--leaf);color:var(--on)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--leaf);outline-offset:2px}
#pill{border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);border-color:transparent;color:var(--mut);font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;padding:7px 12px}
nav{display:flex;gap:4px;margin:0 14px 8px;padding:4px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px}
nav button{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:none;padding:9px;color:var(--mut)}
nav button[aria-selected=true]{background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.14)}
#chat{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
#log{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:8px 14px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.m{max-width:86%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;animation:in .2s ease-out}
.bot{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-left-radius:4px}
.me{align-self:flex-end;background:var(--leaf);color:var(--on);border-bottom-right-radius:4px}
.m button{margin-top:8px}
.fb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.fb button{margin:0;padding:5px 9px;line-height:0;background:none;color:var(--mut);border-radius:8px}
.fb button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.fb button[aria-pressed=true]{opacity:1;color:var(--leaf);border-color:var(--leaf)}
.fb .down[aria-pressed=true]{color:#c0392b;border-color:#c0392b}
.fb .hint{margin:0}
.note{margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.tout{font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;padding:12px 14px;margin:10px 0;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;min-height:3em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
#tinfo{white-space:pre-line}
.opt{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;margin:4px 0;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px}
.opt b{font-weight:600}.opt small{color:var(--mut);font-size:12px}
.opt.out{opacity:.5}
.typing{display:flex;gap:5px;padding:15px 16px}
.typing i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mut);opacity:.4;animation:dot 1s infinite}
.typing i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}.typing i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}
@keyframes dot{50%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-3px)}}
@keyframes in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(5px)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.m,.typing i{animation:none}}
.dock{padding:4px 12px calc(var(--lift) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
.tune{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 8px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)}
.tune input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--leaf)}
.bar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:6px 6px 6px 18px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(20,40,30,.09)}
.bar:focus-within{border-color:var(--leaf)}
textarea,input[type=password],input[type=text]{font:16px/1.4 system-ui;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
#in{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:0;background:none;outline:none;resize:none;padding:9px 0;max-height:120px}
#go{width:42px;height:42px;padding:0;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
#teach{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:4px 14px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}
.stats div{background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.stats b{display:block;font:700 22px "Avenir Next","Trebuchet MS",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}
#teach section{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:12px}
#txt{width:100%;resize:vertical;margin:8px 0}
#tok,#tp{flex:1 1 220px}
.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:8px 0}
.hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin:6px 0}
ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
li button{flex:none;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12.5px}
#brain{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:4px 14px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
#brain section{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:12px}
#brain progress{width:100%;accent-color:var(--leaf)}#bs{white-space:pre-wrap;font:inherit}
#brain select{font:15px system-ui;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
li small{display:block;color:var(--mut);font-size:12px}
/* ===== Sprout 2.0 look: themes, glass panels, motion ===== */
:root{--fs:16px;--w:760px;--r:18px;--glow:rgba(76,192,132,.3);--ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
html[data-theme=aurora]{--bg:#0b0a1a;--panel:#15132b;--soft:#1e1b3d;--ink:#ece9ff;--mut:#9b96c9;--leaf:#8b7cff;--line:#2b2760;--on:#fff;--glow:rgba(139,124,255,.38);color-scheme:dark}
html[data-theme=midnight]{--bg:#06101c;--panel:#0d1b2e;--soft:#12263d;--ink:#e6f1ff;--mut:#8aa4c4;--leaf:#38bdf8;--line:#1d3a5c;--on:#04121f;--glow:rgba(56,189,248,.35);color-scheme:dark}
html[data-theme=sunrise]{--bg:#fff4ea;--panel:#fffaf5;--soft:#fde5d2;--ink:#2a1a12;--mut:#8a6a58;--leaf:#e8590c;--line:#f3d3bb;--on:#fff;--glow:rgba(232,89,12,.28);color-scheme:light}
html[data-theme=mono]{--bg:#f4f4f4;--panel:#fff;--soft:#e8e8e8;--ink:#111;--mut:#666;--leaf:#111;--line:#d6d6d6;--on:#fff;--glow:rgba(0,0,0,.18);color-scheme:light}
html{font-size:var(--fs);background:var(--bg)}
body{max-width:var(--w);background:transparent;font-size:1rem;transition:max-width .4s var(--ease)}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:-20%;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(38% 38% at 18% 18%,var(--glow),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(34% 34% at 82% 28%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--leaf) 26%,transparent),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(40% 40% at 50% 92%,var(--glow),transparent 70%);animation:drift 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
html[data-bg="0"] body::before{animation:none}
@keyframes drift{to{transform:translate3d(4%,3%,0) scale(1.1) rotate(3deg)}}
header{backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
#plant{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--glow);animation:pulse 3.6s ease-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 16px transparent}}
h1{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ink),var(--leaf));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
h1 small{-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mut)}
button,.btn{border-radius:12px;transition:transform .18s var(--ease),filter .18s,box-shadow .25s,background .25s}
button:hover:not(:disabled),.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:none;box-shadow:0 6px 16px var(--glow)}
button:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.96)}
button.pri{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--leaf),color-mix(in srgb,var(--leaf) 70%,#fff));box-shadow:0 4px 14px var(--glow)}
nav{position:relative;gap:0;padding:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--panel) 72%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);overflow:hidden}
nav::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:4px;bottom:4px;left:4px;width:calc((100% - 8px)/var(--n,5));border-radius:999px;background:var(--leaf);transform:translateX(calc(var(--i,0)*100%));transition:transform .5s var(--ease);box-shadow:0 4px 18px var(--glow)}
nav button{position:relative;z-index:1;min-width:0;padding:9px 2px;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:999px;background:none!important;box-shadow:none!important;transform:none!important;transition:color .3s}
nav button[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--on)}
main:not([hidden]){animation:tab .45s var(--ease)}
@keyframes tab{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(16px)}}
#log{scroll-behavior:smooth}
.m{border-radius:var(--r);animation:pop .5s var(--ease)}
@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px) scale(.95)}}
.bot{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--panel) 82%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-color:var(--line);position:relative}
.me{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--leaf),color-mix(in srgb,var(--leaf) 62%,#000));box-shadow:0 6px 20px var(--glow);border-color:transparent}
.m.streaming .fb,.m.streaming .note,.m.streaming>button{opacity:0}
.fb,.note,.m>button{transition:opacity .4s}
.m .cp{position:absolute;top:6px;right:8px;margin:0;padding:2px 8px;font-size:11px;opacity:0;background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px}
.m.bot:hover .cp,.m .cp:focus-visible{opacity:.85}
@media(hover:none){.m .cp{opacity:.5}}
.bot:has(.cp){padding-right:44px}
.typing i{background:var(--leaf)}
.bar{border-radius:30px;box-shadow:0 10px 34px var(--glow);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);transition:box-shadow .3s,border-color .3s}
.bar:focus-within{box-shadow:0 10px 40px var(--glow),0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--leaf) 30%,transparent)}
#go{transition:transform .25s var(--ease)}#go:hover:not(:disabled){transform:scale(1.1) rotate(-8deg)}
.tune button{padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;flex:none}
#know,#settings{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:4px 14px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
#teach section,#brain section,#know section,#settings section{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--panel) 84%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px;margin-top:12px;animation:rise .6s var(--ease) both}
#teach section:nth-child(2),#brain section:nth-child(2),#settings section:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.06s}
#teach section:nth-child(3),#brain section:nth-child(3),#settings section:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.12s}
#brain section:nth-child(n+4),#settings section:nth-child(n+4){animation-delay:.18s}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}}
.stats div{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--panel) 80%,transparent);border:1px solid var(--line);transition:transform .25s var(--ease)}.stats div:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
input:not([type]),input[type=text],input[type=search],input[type=password],select,textarea{font:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
input:not([type]),input[type=password],input[type=search]{width:100%;margin:4px 0}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--leaf);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--leaf) 25%,transparent)}
input[type=range]{accent-color:var(--leaf);width:100%}input[type=color]{width:46px;height:34px;padding:2px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg)}
.set{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}.set:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}.set>span{flex:1}.set select,.set input[type=range]{flex:0 0 46%;width:46%}
*{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--line) transparent}
html[data-compact="1"] .m{padding:7px 11px}html[data-compact="1"] #log{gap:6px}
html[data-anim=off] *,html[data-anim=off] *::before{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html[data-anim=auto] *,html[data-anim=auto] *::before{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <svg id="plant" viewBox="0 0 36 44" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
  <h1>Sprout<small>Starts empty. Learns from you and everyone else.</small></h1>
  <span class="sp"></span>
  <button id="pill" title="Re-sync the community model">…</button>
</header>
<nav role="tablist">
  <button role="tab" id="t-chat" aria-selected="true">Chat</button>
  <button role="tab" id="t-teach" aria-selected="false">Teach</button>
  <button role="tab" id="t-brain" aria-selected="false">Brain</button>
  <button role="tab" id="t-know" aria-selected="false">Knowledge</button>
  <button role="tab" id="t-settings" aria-selected="false">Settings</button>
</nav>

<main id="chat">
  <div id="log" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div class="dock">
    <div class="tune"><span>Focused</span><input id="temp" type="range" min="0.3" max="1.6" step="0.1" value="0.8" aria-label="Creativity"><span>Creative</span></div>
    <div class="bar">
      <textarea id="in" rows="1" placeholder="Ask me something"></textarea>
      <button id="go" class="pri" aria-label="Send"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<main id="know" hidden>
  <section><h2>Knowledge</h2><p class="hint">Entities in Sprout's knowledge graph with their links and what they inherit, plus matching facts.</p><input id="kq" type="search" placeholder="Search entities and facts…" aria-label="Search knowledge" style="width:100%"><ul id="kl"></ul></section>
</main>
<main id="settings" hidden>
  <section><h2>GitHub personal storage</h2><p class="hint">Private memories go to <b>your own private repo</b> (public repos are refused). Nothing uploads unless you press Push. Community sharing is separate and still only touches model.json. Create a fine-grained token limited to that one repo with <b>Contents: Read and write</b>.</p>
    <input id="gow" placeholder="Owner (your GitHub username)" autocomplete="off"><input id="gr" placeholder="Repository name" autocomplete="off"><input id="gb" placeholder="Branch (optional)" autocomplete="off">
    <input id="gt" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Token (never saved unless you tick the box)">
    <label class="hint"><input type="checkbox" id="gk"> Remember on this device, encrypted with a passphrase</label><input id="gp" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Passphrase (to remember or to unlock)">
    <p class="hint">Without the box the token lives only in this tab and is gone on reload. With it, an AES-GCM encrypted copy is kept in this browser; anyone who can run scripts on this page or guess your passphrase could use it, so skip it on shared computers.</p>
    <div class="row"><button id="gs" class="pri">Save</button><button id="gu">Unlock</button><button id="gx">Remove credentials</button></div></section>
  <section><h3>Sync</h3><div id="gf"></div><div class="row"><button id="gl">Pull (merge)</button><button id="gh" class="pri">Push (merge, then upload)</button></div><p id="gm" class="hint" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <p class="hint">Items from the brain file are not uploaded (re-import the file on a new device). Deleted items stay deleted after your next push.</p></section>
  <section><h3>Appearance</h3>
    <label class="set"><span>Theme</span><select data-pref="ui.theme"><option value="auto">Green (follows system)</option><option value="aurora">Aurora</option><option value="midnight">Midnight</option><option value="sunrise">Sunrise</option><option value="mono">Mono</option></select></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Accent colour</span><input type="color" data-pref="ui.accent" value="#1f8a55"></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Text size</span><input type="range" min="14" max="20" step="1" data-pref="ui.font"></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Page width</span><select data-pref="ui.width"><option value="narrow">Narrow</option><option value="normal" selected>Normal</option><option value="wide">Wide</option></select></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Animations</span><select data-pref="ui.anim"><option value="auto">Follow my system</option><option value="on">Always on</option><option value="off">Off</option></select></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Animated background</span><input type="checkbox" data-pref="ui.bg" checked></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Compact messages</span><input type="checkbox" data-pref="ui.compact"></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Reply typing speed</span><select data-pref="ui.speed"><option value="natural">Natural</option><option value="fast">Fast</option><option value="instant">Instant</option></select></label></section>
  <section><h3>Personality &amp; replies</h3>
    <label class="set"><span>Sass</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="60" data-pref="sass"></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Energy (random tangents)</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="50" data-pref="energy"></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Swearing</span><select data-pref="swearlvl"><option value="0">Off</option><option value="1">Mild</option><option value="2">Spicy</option></select></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Answer detail</span><select data-pref="detail"><option value="brief">Brief</option><option value="normal" selected>Normal</option><option value="detailed">Detailed</option></select></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Neural reply picker</span><input type="checkbox" data-pref="lm.use" checked></label>
    <label class="set"><span>Candidates to compare</span><input type="range" min="1" max="10" step="1" value="6" data-pref="lmk"></label>
    <p class="hint">Serious topics always switch the jokes and swearing off.</p></section>
  <section><h3>Data</h3><p class="hint">Back up first (Brain tab > Export). This erases everything Sprout 2.0 stored in this browser: memories, graph, trained net and settings.</p><div class="row"><button id="gz">Erase Sprout 2.0 memory</button></div></section>
  <section><h3>Profile</h3><input id="gn" placeholder="Display name (saved in profile.json)" maxlength="60"></section>
</main>
<main id="brain" hidden>
  <div class="stats"><div><b id="b1">0</b>memories</div><div><b id="b2">0</b>graph links</div><div><b id="b3">0</b>concepts</div></div>
  <section><h2>Live reasoning</h2><p class="hint">The real stages from the last message Sprout handled, written by the engine as it ran.</p><ul id="trace"></ul></section>
  <section><h3>Import a brain file</h3><p class="hint">Load sprout_brain.txt or any file in the same record format. It is read in small slices so the page stays responsive, and you can cancel. Your existing memories are kept.</p>
    <div class="row"><button id="b0" class="pri">Load built-in starter brain</button><label class="btn" for="bf">Choose file</label><input id="bf" type="file" accept=".txt,text/plain" hidden><button id="bx" disabled>Cancel</button></div>
    <progress id="bp" value="0" max="1" hidden></progress><p id="bs" class="hint" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
  <section><h3>Type brain info</h3><p class="hint">One fact per line: <b>Penguins are birds</b>, <b>Birds can fly</b>, or <b>question => answer</b>. Or paste full records like [FACT] ... [/FACT]. Saved as taught by you.</p>
    <textarea id="bi" rows="5" style="width:100%" placeholder="Dolphins are mammals&#10;What is a sprout? => A young plant"></textarea><div class="row"><button id="ba" class="pri">Add to brain</button></div><p id="bm" class="hint" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
  <section><h3>Intent network</h3><p class="hint">A small neural net trained from scratch in this browser on conversation examples from the brain file plus your chat lines (labelled by my rules). It only overrides the rules for casual messages and slang.</p><div class="row"><button id="bn">Train now</button></div><p id="bns" class="hint"></p></section>
  <section><h3>Learn from Wikipedia <small>beta</small></h3><p class="hint">Type a topic. Sprout fetches the intro from Wikipedia (public API, one lookup per press), shows the sentences, and learns the ones you keep, for answers and for word patterns. It trusts them less than the brain file, keeps them on this device only, and never includes them in community sharing. Text is from Wikipedia (CC BY-SA); each fact keeps its page link.</p>
    <div class="row"><input id="wq" placeholder="e.g. penguin, black holes, jazz" style="flex:1" autocomplete="off"><button id="wb" class="pri">Fetch</button></div><ul id="wl"></ul><div class="row"><button id="wk" hidden>Learn selected</button></div><p id="wm" class="hint" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
  <section><h3>Neural language model</h3><p class="hint">A small neural network trained from scratch on Sprout's own text (brain file, facts, Wikipedia pages you taught). It learns word embeddings and which word tends to come next, using backpropagation in a background worker. Jobs: it picks the most fluent of several candidate replies (Settings), and you can watch it continue a phrase below. With this little text it is more of a fluency judge than a writer.</p>
