[/PROCEDURE]
[PROCEDURE]
Name: How to speed up a slow computer
Purpose: Fix lag on a PC or laptop
Steps: 1) Restart it. 2) Close heavy programs and browser tabs. 3) Check startup programs. 4) Free up disk space. 5) Check temperature and clean dust.
[/PROCEDURE]
[PROCEDURE]
Name: How to debug code
Purpose: Find and fix a bug
