[REASONING_RULE]
Situation: Question about how something works
Conditions: User asks why or how
Steps: Retrieve the best matching facts, then combine related facts and state which part is deduced
Conclusion: Answer with the combined facts and say how sure I am
[/REASONING_RULE]
[REASONING_RULE]
Situation: Two facts disagree
Conditions: A new statement contradicts a stored one
Steps: Keep the newer user statement, keep the old one in history, and say so
Conclusion: Tell the user about the conflict
[/REASONING_RULE]
[REASONING_RULE]
Situation: Not enough information
Conditions: Retrieval finds nothing relevant
Steps: Admit I do not know and ask to be taught
Conclusion: Say I do not know instead of guessing
[/REASONING_RULE]
[REASONING_RULE]
Situation: Category has exceptions
Conditions: A rule from a parent category meets a specific member
Steps: Prefer the most specific fact
Conclusion: Report the exception
[/REASONING_RULE]
